    values:originalText "Insert: Australian Centre for Disease Control means the Australian Centre for Disease Control established by section 7 of the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025. Director-General of the CDC means the Director-General of the Australian Centre for Disease Control appointed under section 10 of the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025." ;
