doc:sch-1-sec-544a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "544A(3) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) However, the Director of Human Biosecurity must not delegate the Director’s functions or powers under any of the following provisions: (a) section 113 (human health response zones); (b) section 570 (issuing identity cards); (c) section 618 (declared movements)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "544A(4) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Also, the Director of Human Biosecurity may delegate a function or power under Part 3 of Chapter 2 (human biosecurity control orders) only to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the Health Department who is a human biosecurity officer.  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 1 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Also, the Director of Human Biosecurity may delegate a function or power under Part 3 of Chapter 2 (human biosecurity control orders) only to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the Health Department who is a human biosecurity officer.  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 1 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e0cc68ac7d4b59b809c1fc91853c7e0e8c7d643bcbcd307e3261987836d43771" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of Director's functions or powers" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2025a00062.pdf> ;
