doc:sch-1-sec-544a-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "544A(4) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Also, the Director of Human Biosecurity may delegate a function or power under Part 3 of Chapter 2 (human biosecurity control orders) only to an SES employee, or an acting SES employee, in the Health Department who is a human biosecurity officer.  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 1 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "544A(5) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-544a-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) A human biosecurity officer cannot, under a delegation to which subsection (4) applies, perform a function or exercise a power under section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order if the human biosecurity officer: (a) imposed the order under paragraph 60(1)(b); or (b) made the request under subsection 71(3) in relation to the order." ;
    skos:definition "(5) A human biosecurity officer cannot, under a delegation to which subsection (4) applies, perform a function or exercise a power under section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order if the human biosecurity officer: (a) imposed the order under paragraph 60(1)(b); or (b) made the request under subsection 71(3) in relation to the order."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5494257a6ac06dac6da5d43035bca280c39929a5cc4e1cea4b9b93b9ec26dac9" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Cannot perform function or exercise power under section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
