    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) A human biosecurity officer cannot, under a delegation to which subsection (4) applies, perform a function or exercise a power under section 72 in relation to a human biosecurity control order if the human biosecurity officer: (a) imposed the order under paragraph 60(1)(b); or (b) made the request under subsection 71(3) in relation to the order." ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "544A(6) Delegation of Director’s functions or powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-544a-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) In performing any functions or exercising any powers under a delegation made under subsection (1), the delegate must comply with any directions of the Director of Human Biosecurity." ;
    skos:definition "(6) In performing any functions or exercising any powers under a delegation made under subsection (1), the delegate must comply with any directions of the Director of Human Biosecurity."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0b24d6ae5a14407bdc7c9e3ea8edbe05f5566da2b4b69f5332ea68df15aa1819" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-544a ;
    cof:pageNumber "8"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Delegation of Director's functions or powers must comply with directions of the Director of Human Biosecurity." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
