concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 Subsection 3(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: Australian Centre for Disease Control means the Australian Centre for Disease Control established by section 7 of the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025. Director-General of the CDC means the Director-General of the Australian Centre for Disease Control appointed under section 10 of the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: Australian Centre for Disease Control means the Australian Centre for Disease Control established by section 7 of the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025. Director-General of the CDC means the Director-General of the Australian Centre for Disease Control appointed under section 10 of the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025."@en ;
