concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-24a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "24A Defence for use of information authorised under the Australian"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-24a ;
    values:originalText "Centre for Disease Control Act 2025 Section 21 does not apply if: (a) a person obtains protected information; and (b) the person makes a record of, or discloses or otherwise uses, the information; and (c) the record, disclosure or use is authorised under the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this section: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code." ;
    skos:definition "Centre for Disease Control Act 2025 Section 21 does not apply if: (a) a person obtains protected information; and (b) the person makes a record of, or discloses or otherwise uses, the information; and (c) the record, disclosure or use is authorised under the Australian Centre for Disease Control Act 2025. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in this section: see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "27c93295f368160b2a537157582ab4c1b52991d8f2bad94c0dd406b9f5b5f7ae" ;
    cof:pageNumber "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defendant bears evidential burden in relation to protected information." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2025a00062.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2025a00062.pdf, p.11" ;
    cml:asserts concept:c2025a00062-sch-1-sec-24a-norm .
