concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7 Saving of identity cards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-7 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An identity card issued to a chief human biosecurity officer or a human biosecurity officer under subsection 570(1) of the old Biosecurity Act before the transition time is taken, after that time, to have been issued under that subsection of the new Biosecurity Act. (2) If, immediately before the transition time, a form was approved by the Health Secretary for the purposes of paragraph 570(2)(a) of the old Biosecurity Act, the form is taken, at and after the transition time, to be approved by the Health Secretary, in the capacity of the Director of Human Biosecurity, for the purposes of that paragraph of the new Biosecurity Act.  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 2 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025" ;
    skos:definition "(1) An identity card issued to a chief human biosecurity officer or a human biosecurity officer under subsection 570(1) of the old Biosecurity Act before the transition time is taken, after that time, to have been issued under that subsection of the new Biosecurity Act. (2) If, immediately before the transition time, a form was approved by the Health Secretary for the purposes of paragraph 570(2)(a) of the old Biosecurity Act, the form is taken, at and after the transition time, to be approved by the Health Secretary, in the capacity of the Director of Human Biosecurity, for the purposes of that paragraph of the new Biosecurity Act.  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 2 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a08d91234c7f17a8343220c167577409397508703c1bd6b819407fa19b48fbf3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Saving of identity cards issued before transition time" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2025a00062.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2025a00062.pdf, p.36" ;
