doc:sch-2-sec-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7 Saving of identity cards" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An identity card issued to a chief human biosecurity officer or a human biosecurity officer under subsection 570(1) of the old Biosecurity Act before the transition time is taken, after that time, to have been issued under that subsection of the new Biosecurity Act. (2) If, immediately before the transition time, a form was approved by the Health Secretary for the purposes of paragraph 570(2)(a) of the old Biosecurity Act, the form is taken, at and after the transition time, to be approved by the Health Secretary, in the capacity of the Director of Human Biosecurity, for the purposes of that paragraph of the new Biosecurity Act.  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the Biosecurity Act 2015  Part 2 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025" ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Saving of listed human disease determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies if a determination made under subsection 42(1) of the old Biosecurity Act is in force immediately before the transition time. (2) The determination has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC in accordance with section 42 of the new Biosecurity Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies if a determination made under subsection 42(1) of the old Biosecurity Act is in force immediately before the transition time. (2) The determination has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC in accordance with section 42 of the new Biosecurity Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9e2d3c8c2deeedbcfcbaf9d8c05bfb793db2643abf32eaa35a0d88b807fd9f34" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Preserves listed human disease determinations made under the old Biosecurity Act." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
