concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Transitional—transfer of documents to Health Secretary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies to any records or documents that: (a) relate to a function or power of the Director of Human Biosecurity under the Biosecurity Act 2015 (other than section 42 or 169 of that Act); and (b) immediately before the transition time, were in the possession of: (i) the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer; or (ii) an APS employee in the Health Department; or (iii) a delegate of the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer. (2) The records and documents are to be transferred to the Health Secretary after the transition time. Note: Any records and documents transferred are Commonwealth records for the purposes of the Archives Act 1983. (3) The transitional rules may provide that: (a) subitem (2) does not apply to specified records or documents; or (b) subitem (2) does not apply to records or documents that relate to a specified function or power of the Director of Human Biosecurity. (4) Subitem (3) does not limit subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies to any records or documents that: (a) relate to a function or power of the Director of Human Biosecurity under the Biosecurity Act 2015 (other than section 42 or 169 of that Act); and (b) immediately before the transition time, were in the possession of: (i) the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer; or (ii) an APS employee in the Health Department; or (iii) a delegate of the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer. (2) The records and documents are to be transferred to the Health Secretary after the transition time. Note: Any records and documents transferred are Commonwealth records for the purposes of the Archives Act 1983. (3) The transitional rules may provide that: (a) subitem (2) does not apply to specified records or documents; or (b) subitem (2) does not apply to records or documents that relate to a specified function or power of the Director of Human Biosecurity. (4) Subitem (3) does not limit subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "191cf7ee9f360d6dce22b565e622194bd26bd79da970bef7df018da5f18f8642" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Transfer of documents to Health Secretary after transition time." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
