    cof:title "9 Transitional—transfer of documents to Health Secretary" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies to any records or documents that: (a) relate to a function or power of the Director of Human Biosecurity under the Biosecurity Act 2015 (other than section 42 or 169 of that Act); and (b) immediately before the transition time, were in the possession of: (i) the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer; or (ii) an APS employee in the Health Department; or (iii) a delegate of the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer. (2) The records and documents are to be transferred to the Health Secretary after the transition time. Note: Any records and documents transferred are Commonwealth records for the purposes of the Archives Act 1983. (3) The transitional rules may provide that: (a) subitem (2) does not apply to specified records or documents; or (b) subitem (2) does not apply to records or documents that relate to a specified function or power of the Director of Human Biosecurity. (4) Subitem (3) does not limit subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901." ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "10 Saving of delegations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-10 ;
    values:originalText "Despite the repeal and substitution of section 544A of the Biosecurity Act 2015 a delegation under that section that was in force immediately before the transition time continues in force after that time as if it were made under section 544A of the new Biosecurity Act.  Schedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions" ;
    skos:definition "Despite the repeal and substitution of section 544A of the Biosecurity Act 2015 a delegation under that section that was in force immediately before the transition time continues in force after that time as if it were made under section 544A of the new Biosecurity Act.  Schedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "41f05268f9533c5e4827e82893f23cdd9534373689aa351741ccd44406247513" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer ;
