concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Things done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary for the purposes of: (a) the old NHS Act; or (b) a legislative instrument made under the old NHS Act; then the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC. (2) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary for the purposes of: (a) the old NHS Act; or (b) a legislative instrument made under the old NHS Act; then the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC. (2) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1e917933271192fe1755c8c3d6aff05bca91ac0f5760f6b64b56a8687324ea2c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Things done by, or in relation to, the Health Secretary have effect as if done by the Director-General of the CDC." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
