concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 References to the Health Secretary in instruments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies to an instrument if: (a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and (b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition time; and (c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary. (2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC. (3) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in relation to a specified instrument or a specified reference. (4) This item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or repealed after the commencement of this item. (5) In this item: instrument includes: (a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and (b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the National Health Security Act 2007  Part 3 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025 (c) an instrument made under the old NHS Act or regulations made under the old NHS Act." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies to an instrument if: (a) the instrument was made under the old NHS Act; and (b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition time; and (c) the instrument contains a reference to the Health Secretary. (2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Health Secretary were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC. (3) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in relation to a specified instrument or a specified reference. (4) This item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or repealed after the commencement of this item. (5) In this item: instrument includes: (a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and (b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the National Health Security Act 2007  Part 3 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025 (c) an instrument made under the old NHS Act or regulations made under the old NHS Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e54256165247ae5bab8a1518f21c3b8200a59c3722b015983cabd930f62cddc6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "38"^^xsd:integer ;
