concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 Temporary additions to the National Notifiable Disease"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "List If, immediately before the transition time: (a) a variation of the National Notifiable Disease List was in force under subsection 12(1) of the old NHS Act; and (b) the variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer; then the variation has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC.  Schedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions" ;
    skos:definition "List If, immediately before the transition time: (a) a variation of the National Notifiable Disease List was in force under subsection 12(1) of the old NHS Act; and (b) the variation was made by the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer; then the variation has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been made by the Director-General of the CDC.  Schedule 2  Application, saving and transitional provisions"@en ;
