concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "Medical Officer (1) If, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer for the purposes of: (a) the old NORDR Act; or (b) a legislative instrument made under the old NORDR Act; then the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC. (2) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer." ;
    skos:definition "Medical Officer (1) If, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer for the purposes of: (a) the old NORDR Act; or (b) a legislative instrument made under the old NORDR Act; then the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC. (2) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a738401a90fe209eeb016efa4ade0794319dd3a92b119873a34acf793b31163c" ;
