doc:sch-2-sec-15 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "15 Things done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Medical Officer (1) If, before the transition time, a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer for the purposes of: (a) the old NORDR Act; or (b) a legislative instrument made under the old NORDR Act; then the thing has effect, at and after the transition time, as if it had been done by, or in relation to, the Director-General of the CDC. (2) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer." ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-16 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16 References to the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer in"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16 ;
    values:originalText "instruments (1) This item applies to an instrument if: (a) the instrument was made under the old NORDR Act; and (b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition time; and (c) the instrument contains a reference to the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer. (2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC. (3) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in relation to a specified instrument or a specified reference. (4) This item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or repealed after the commencement of this item. (5) In this item:  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry Act 2023  Part 4 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025 instrument includes: (a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and (b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and (c) an instrument made under the old NORDR Act or rules made under the old NORDR Act." ;
    skos:definition "instruments (1) This item applies to an instrument if: (a) the instrument was made under the old NORDR Act; and (b) the instrument was in force immediately before the transition time; and (c) the instrument contains a reference to the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer. (2) The instrument has effect, at and after the transition time, as if a reference in the instrument to the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer were a reference to the Director-General of the CDC. (3) The transitional rules may provide that subitem (2) does not apply in relation to a specified instrument or a specified reference. (4) This item does not prevent the instrument from being amended or repealed after the commencement of this item. (5) In this item:  Application, saving and transitional provisions  Schedule 2 Provisions relating to the amendment of the National Occupational Respiratory Disease Registry Act 2023  Part 4 No. 62, 2025 Australian Centre for Disease Control (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2025 instrument includes: (a) a contract, deed, undertaking, arrangement or agreement; and (b) a notice, authority, order or instruction; and (c) an instrument made under the old NORDR Act or rules made under the old NORDR Act."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0c48edfe5409059e042e6d70e7c479128be1603ffc4df6698f0610ec72686c3a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer ;
