concept:c2025a00062-sch-2-sec-17 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17 Legal proceedings involving the Commonwealth Chief"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-17 ;
    values:originalText "Medical Officer or Health Secretary (1) If, immediately before the transition time, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer was a party to proceedings relating to the old NORDR Act that were pending in any court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer as a party to the proceedings at and after that time. (2) If, immediately before the transition time, the Health Secretary was a party to proceedings relating to the old NORDR Act that were pending in any court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for the Health Secretary as a party to the proceedings at and after that time. [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 3 September 2025 Senate on 27 October 2025] (69/25)" ;
    skos:definition "Medical Officer or Health Secretary (1) If, immediately before the transition time, the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer was a party to proceedings relating to the old NORDR Act that were pending in any court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for the Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer as a party to the proceedings at and after that time. (2) If, immediately before the transition time, the Health Secretary was a party to proceedings relating to the old NORDR Act that were pending in any court or tribunal, the Director-General of the CDC is substituted for the Health Secretary as a party to the proceedings at and after that time. [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 3 September 2025 Senate on 27 October 2025] (69/25)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1a9a3abf06efb37aaf3f2ae4c6f91c50e65e89e37a3ddba88cc83dfd9a3e49f4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Substitution of Director-General for Commonwealth Chief Medical Officer and Health Secretary in pending proceedings." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
